#: src/main.ui:73
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Picha za uso wako ambazo Ubuntu Hello zinalinganishwa dhidi yake. Weka "
"angalau mbili, kumbukumbu katika taa tofauti."

#: src/main.ui:95
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Inaonyesha miundo iliyohifadhiwa ya:"

#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Muundo mmoja tu wa uso umeandikishwa. Taa hubadilisha jinsi uso wako "
"unavyoonekana kwenye kamera, hivyo mfano mmoja unaweza kushindwa jioni chini "
"ya taa (au mchana). Ongeza muundo wa pili uliorekodiwa kwa mwanga tofauti "
"ili kuendelea kufungua kutegemewa wakati wowote wa siku."

#: src/main.ui:144
