#: src/main.ui:435
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Arifa ya eneo-kazi huonyesha wakati Ubuntu Hello inatafuta uso wako, kisha "
"inaripoti matokeo. Majaribio yaliyoshindikana yabaki kwenye orodha ya arifa."

#: src/main.ui:466
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Onyesha arifa"

#: src/main.ui:472
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Kadi moja kwa kila jaribio la uthibitishaji wa uso, imesasishwa mahali pake "
"na tokeo."

#: src/main.ui:503
