msgstr "Sauti za arifa"

#: src/main.ui:509
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Cheza sauti ya mfumo kwa jaribio linalotambuliwa au lisilofanikiwa."

#: src/main.ui:540
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Jumuisha uchunguzi"

#: src/main.ui:546
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Ongeza muundo, uhakika dhidi ya kizingiti, fremu, kamera na muda kwa kila "
"kadi. Inafaa wakati wa kuripoti tatizo."

#: src/main.ui:610 src/onboarding.ui:707
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Uwekaji ufunguo / KWallet Fungua Kiotomatiki"

#: src/main.ui:624
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Washa uthibitishaji wa uso ili kufungua kiotomatiki ufunguo wako wa kuingia "
"au KWallet unapoingia. Hii huhifadhi nenosiri lako lililofungwa katika TPM "
"linapopatikana, au limesimbwa kwa njia fiche kwa AES-256-GCM kwa kutumia "
"ufunguo mkuu wa mzizi pekee. Seti za uthibitishaji wa uso PAM_AUTHTOK kwa "
"pam_gnome_keyring au pam_kwallet5 kulingana na eneo-kazi lako."

